'''Zed's Better Workshop Upload''' is a [[ZombieBuddy]] mod that enhances the in-game Steam Workshop uploader, providing extra features:
* The description can be pulled from a file via a <code>@include()</code> directive
* Automatic filtering of common unwanted files
** Configurable via an exclusion patterns file via mod options <code>.workshopignore</code>
* Preview of files that will be uploaded before submission
* Sorted workshop items list (alphabetically)
* Escape key goes on the previous page
